{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/logo.png?t=1748733255\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run your dream sushi restaurant in a wild and cheeky simulation like no other!</strong> \ud83c\udf63\ud83d\udc58</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Body Sushi</i>, a bold sushi restaurant simulator where your creativity, management skills, and a touch of mischief collide. Build, customize, and grow your sushi business\u2014but disaster strikes on opening day! \ud83d\udca5 Will you rise from the chaos or be served raw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 As the owner, you'll prepare perfect sushi, manage the restaurant flow, and meet colorful, quirky characters with wild personalities and their own demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf71 Huge variety of sushi styles to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/ezgif-40c4bbdcb7ff36.gif?t=1748733255\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc58 Customize and serve on your own <i>nyotaimori</i> (body sushi) plates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/ezgif-46728ccc31991a.gif?t=1748733255\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc96 Recruit adorable waifus with unique skills and stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/ezgif-4ca001a3810f04.gif?t=1748733255\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f Funny, spicy, and unforgettable gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/ezgif-4f8a6c9ac45914.gif?t=1748733255\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 More exciting features coming soon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Add to your Steam Wishlist</strong> to follow our dev log and be the first to know about updates!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430330?t=1748733255","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748733255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/d05baedf222558af510a603693d8d180fd9edf31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748733255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/d05baedf222558af510a603693d8d180fd9edf31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748733255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"As this game is a nyotaimori (body sushi) simulation game, some nudity will be depicted. However, there is a streamer mode in the game, off by default. If turned on, all characters wear proper clothing under all circumstances to make sure it's safe for general streaming purposes."},"demos":[{"appid":3588560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/logo.png?t=1748733255\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run your dream sushi restaurant in a wild and cheeky simulation like no other!</strong> \ud83c\udf63\ud83d\udc58</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Body Sushi</i>, a bold sushi restaurant simulator where your creativity, management skills, and a touch of mischief collide. Build